abstract: >-
  Runtimes of 704 container executions from a campaign in which every job ran on every machine of a
  four-machine cloud-edge fleet (two amd64 servers and two Raspberry Pi boards) under controlled
  background load, at 70 chronological forecast origins over seven workload families. The archive
  holds the paired dataset with its issue-time features, the outputs of the confirmatory
  forecasting and placement analysis, the frozen acquisition and analysis specifications, and the
  scripts that rebuild the tables and figures of the accompanying article.
keywords:
  - runtime forecasting
  - cloud-edge computing continuum
  - heterogeneous computing
  - deadline-aware placement
  - conformal prediction
  - Kubernetes
